{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261020/photo/bkn-20261020200033077-1020_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261020215530\"/><p>今晚(20日)第112期六合彩攪珠結果：2、5、7、8、21、29，特別號碼為31。頭獎1.5注中，每注派彩11,502,480；二獎5.5注中，每注派彩254,510港元；三獎301.9注中，每注派彩19,200港元。</p><p>下期六合彩攪珠將於周四(10月22日)舉行，估計頭獎基金可達8,000,000港元。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T14:01:50.199923+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":161,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T12:00:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-20T15:58:20.276719+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T13:57:48.450442+00:00","content_hash":"157ea37d624bfeac30bb5aff4687ea15dda7ebbd91dd0823a95b410a506199e7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}